Enhancement: Use a faster zstd implementation

Restic compressed and decompressed repository data with klauspost/compress.
It now uses fastcompress, a pure-Go port of zstd 1.5.7, which uses less CPU and
memory when running `restic backup`, in particular with `--compression max`.
The compressed format is unchanged, so repositories remain compatible with
earlier restic versions.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/22210
